Notes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

* Only two files of this package are real ports (`src/AnsiParser.ts` and
  `src/FuzzySearch.ts`). The files that implement a *pattern* studied in an
  upstream (without translating code) say so explicitly in their header
  ("implementación propia de Ego") and do NOT carry the canonical attribution
  header: inventing one would be a false attribution (precedent EGO-FIND-83).
* `scripts/check-attribution.mjs` verifies, against
  `provenance.manifest.json`, that every derived file carries its canonical
  header with the right upstream, licence and origin path; that no native
  file carries one; and that the package keeps a licence notice for every
  upstream in use.
* The upstreams are not redistributed: only the derived portions are, under
  the terms of their MIT licences (see `LICENSE.md`).
